---
title: Product Types
description: Learn about the different product types available in FOSSBilling.
---

FOSSBilling supports multiple product types for selling hosting, domains, licenses, downloads, and other digital services from one installation.

{% cardgrid stagger=true %}
{% card title="Hosting" icon="server" %}
Sell shared hosting accounts with control panel integration.
{% /card %}
{% card title="Domains" icon="globe" %}
Resell domain registrations through various registrars.
{% /card %}
{% card title="Downloadable" icon="download" %}
Sell digital downloads and files.
{% /card %}
{% card title="License" icon="key" %}
Issue and validate software licenses.
{% /card %}
{% card title="API Keys" icon="code" %}
Sell API keys for your applications.
{% /card %}
{% /cardgrid %}
